{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1960,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember when I was a kid waiting an hour for my favorite TV show to come on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6020,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which was Sharon, Lois \u0026 Bram."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7740,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That felt like eternity, but as I've gotten older, everything seems to have sped up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13800,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Time is going much faster. That's something virtually everyone agrees upon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17740,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Yeah, I feel like- I feel like it does.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18820,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Oh man, so much.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20180,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Each year sort of gets faster and faster.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22180,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But why is this? Is it just an illusion or are there good scientific reasons why time appears to go faster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27620,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as we get older?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29040,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I'm working with the National Geographic Channel's Brain Games, a show that explores"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32740,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the inner workings of the human mind through experiments and interactive games to test out some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37400,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "theories about why this actually occurs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39660,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a reasonable sounding argument that says each year goes faster because it makes up a smaller fraction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45600,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your entire life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46960,
    "dDurationMs": 9080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Let's say I was only 20. One year is only 1/20th of my age. But when I'm 67, one year is 1/67th of my age.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56040,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This graph shows one year as a percentage of your life at each age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60360,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what I find weird about this is if you add up the area underneath the curve, you'll find that you've already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66300,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lived half of the total by age 6."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69140,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I really don't think this is how our brains perceive time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72400,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You really think that, like, a day now is-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74700,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Of course not.\" [laughter]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77160,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there are better reasons why time appears to speed up as we get older."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81940,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've come to Venice Beach to find two groups of people: The older and younger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86160,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to see if their perceptions of time differ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88480,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what I want to do is I want to set my timer going and without counting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92560,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you tell me when you think a minute is up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94140,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Let's go.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94640,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95140,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Okay.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95640,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everywhere around the world, when this experiment is performed, older people typically overestimate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100320,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while younger people measure it quite accurately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102920,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Alright, probably stop?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104300,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Yep.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105420,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wooo, one minute, two seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108380,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A minute and two seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109880,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A minute and five."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110760,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As we get older, the rate at which our neurons fire, or our neuron conduction velocity, it decreases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117480,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can think of this firing rate a little bit like an internal clock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121180,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, if our internal clock is slowing down, that would make everything else, external time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126960,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seem to be speeding up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128740,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I'm going to tell you the time.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130020,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130520,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Now.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131020,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"One minute.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132100,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's it? That was one minute?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133860,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"One minute.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134420,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Minute, seventeen seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135960,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Not bad, right?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136460,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137020,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I thought I'd be a lot closer actually, but I guess I wasn't.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139160,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you want to know what it really was?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142480,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One minute forty seven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143440,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"No way, it was almost two minutes? It was actually almost two minutes.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146880,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"It really is amazing how fast time flies by, it really is.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149940,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our sense of time, or chronoception, is not like one of the standard five senses. It has no specialized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156500,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "receptor cells and it does not appear to be localized in just one part of the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161400,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perhaps this suggests that it's not one coherent thing at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165560,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it does seem that our perception of time is very fundamental."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168800,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Studies of rats have shown that even with their neocortex removed - that is, the higher order thinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174000,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "part of their brains- They are still able to learn how to time forty seconds accurately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179700,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's quite remarkable, and it suggests our sense of time evolved early and is one of the fundamental"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185540,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "functions of the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186980,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that doesn't mean out brains always represent time faithfully."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190500,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, have you noticed that really good movies seem to go by much faster than they actually are?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195860,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or do you notice that your vacations fly by? There are good reasons for this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200680,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we're focused on something, we don't notice that time is passing and that makes them feel in the moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205960,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shorter than they actually are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208120,
    "dDurationMs": 7700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At its best, this results in a mental state called \"flow\". This can happen when playing sports or video games"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215820,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or artists when they're fully engrossed in their work or people meditating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219800,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I would argue another reason time speeds up as we age is because we are more often engrossed in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225340,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what we're doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226060,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another thing that appears to make time speed up is repetition. I'm going to show you a series of images"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231480,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I want you to consider how long each one appears on the screen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235240,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you ready?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236620,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240540,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So which one appeared to last the longest? If you're like most people, you'd probably say the dog."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245500,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But all of those images actually appeared on screen fore the same length of time. The dog seemed longer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250300,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it was novel and therefore, your brain had to invest more energy in processing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254840,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's remarkable is that our sense of how long something is - or subjective duration-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259920,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It correlates highly with how much energy we're using in our brains. Now, if you study how much energy people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266140,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use in their brains over the course of their lifetime, you'll find that it peaks around age five."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270980,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you think about it, this kind of makes sense because when you're a kid, almost everything is novel to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276040,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And therefore, your brain needs to use more energy, fully 66% of your resting energy intake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282000,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's used by the brain because of all the novel experiences and that must, at least in part,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287380,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "explain why time appears to go more slowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290060,
    "dDurationMs": 8300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what can we do to slow time down? Well, studies have shown that being afraid increases our perception"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298360,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299360,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When arachnophobes were forced to stare at spiders for 45 seconds - Yes, this is a real experiment -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305920,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those arachnophobes judged that experience as lasting much longer than 45 seconds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310480,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you would kind of expect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312320,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, experiments involving skydivers or people falling showed that they judged their experience to last"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318200,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much longer than it actually is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320360,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another time when time appears to pass slowly is when you're bored."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324300,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"You know, when you're waiting and waiting, that's all you think about, so it seems like time drags forever.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329700,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since there is so little to focus on, you are acutely aware of just how much time is passing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335000,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so these boring moments drag on and on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337800,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, if you really want to slow down your experience of time, you could scare yourself, take up extreme sports,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343580,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get into accidents and intersperse all of that with periods of boredom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347700,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this viewpoint ignores one important fact, which is that we don't experience time as just one thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355320,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We think about time as it passe, but also as it has passed before, when we remember it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361620,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those two ways of looking at time, they don't align."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365300,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for example, holidays, they feel like they go by really fast, but when you think back upon them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370680,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they last a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372880,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because you had a lot of novel experiences and your brain formed a lot of memories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376880,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it judges the duration of that vacation by the number of memories that were formed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382340,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All that novelty means lots of memories means it feels like it took a long time, but in the moment, it felt fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389300,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the paradox, the great paradox, of our perception of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394020,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want time to go slowly, there are a lot of things you can expose yourself to that will slow time down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400140,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they won't necessarily be pleasant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402460,
    "dDurationMs": 7380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maybe the happiest life and the longest remembered life is one where time really seems to fly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410500,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like Einstein said, \"Put your hand on a stove for a minute and it'll feel like an hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415800,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But sit next to a pretty girl for an hour and it'll feel like a minute.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420880,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what would you like your life to feel like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427680,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to thank the National Geographic Channel for sponsoring this episode of Veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431960,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want to introduce more novelty into your life, than you should check out their series, \"Brain Games\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436720,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The new season begins February 14th at 9/8 Central. And this season, they have an episode about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442020,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all of your senses, including your sense of time, chronoception."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445960,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to find out more, than check out the link to their website in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450280,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And thank you for watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458800,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did that feel like that lasted long?"
    } ]
  } ]
}
